00:26:21,621 --> 00:26:24,791
Whoever loses their shit now

262
00:26:26,668 --> 00:26:27,502
is the fake.

263
00:26:30,046 --> 00:26:32,799
We just have to catch that bastard
and rough him up.

264
00:26:55,447 --> 00:26:57,490
Where is he?

265
00:26:58,283 --> 00:27:00,285
ADOPTION CERTIFICATE (DETAILED)

266
00:27:00,368 --> 00:27:02,954
Where the hell is an uncle here?

267
00:27:46,039 --> 00:27:46,873
Huh?

268
00:27:47,374 --> 00:27:49,167
But he never came out of here.

269
00:28:44,472 --> 00:28:46,099
Let me ask you something.

270
00:28:46,725 --> 00:28:47,559
Okay?

271
00:28:49,644 --> 00:28:50,520
What

272
00:28:51,396 --> 00:28:53,314
