273
00:28:54,232 --> 00:28:56,609
Just shut up and sit tight.

274
00:28:56,693 --> 00:28:58,486
We know what you used to do.

275
00:29:00,613 --> 00:29:01,531
Okay.

276
00:29:01,614 --> 00:29:03,408
Well, let's say you do know.

277
00:29:04,701 --> 00:29:06,286
What am I being arrested for now?

278
00:29:06,369 --> 00:29:09,789
Kwak Sang-cheol spilled everything.
You buried people in the gang.

279
00:29:12,584 --> 00:29:15,003
Kwak Sang-cheol? Who's that?

280
00:29:15,086 --> 00:29:17,380
A front for a hold'em bar.

281
00:29:17,881 --> 00:29:20,967
You'll recognize him.
You were in the same gang.

282
00:31:11,202 --> 00:31:12,912
- What?
- Three dead.

283
00:31:12,996 --> 00:31:14,414
One severely injured.

284
00:31:14,497 --> 00:31:16,791
They say Major Crimes is in chaos now.

285
00:31:16,875 --> 00:31:20,712
Wasn't he the guy Sun-yong was after?
What happened to him?

286
00:31:20,795 --> 00:31:21,963
He got away.

287
00:31:22,046 --> 00:31:25,008
Wow, that crazy bastard is killing cops?

288
00:31:25,508 --> 00:31:27,802
We would've been screwed
if we took that case.

289
00:31:27,886 --> 00:31:30,054
- Yeah, we would've.
- Hey.

290
00:31:31,472 --> 00:31:33,182
Our guys are there.

291
00:31:33,266 --> 00:31:34,392
Find out where they are.

292
00:31:34,475 --> 00:31:35,560
Is Sun-yong there?

293
00:31:36,185 --> 00:31:38,271
Come to think of it,
I don't see Min-ho either.

294
00:31:38,855 --> 00:31:40,440
- Why did he go there?
- Huh?

295
00:31:40,523 --> 00:31:41,900
- No. Wait.
- Hold on.

296
00:31:41,983 --> 00:31:43,526
- Where are you going?
- To get them.

297
00:31:43,610 --> 00:31:46,195
Wait! It's Major Crimes' case.
Why are we going?

298
00:31:46,279 --> 00:31:48,156
If our guys are there, it's our case!

299
00:31:48,239 --> 00:31:49,365
Hurry up and follow me.

300
00:31:50,909 --> 00:31:51,784
Come on, sir!

301
00:31:53,870 --> 00:31:54,996
Crap.

302
00:31:57,999 --> 00:32:01,085
Too bad. I liked the color.

303
00:32:03,129 --> 00:32:05,798
Back in the day, fuck,
everything I touched turned to gold.

304
00:32:05,882 --> 00:32:07,967
Fuck, do I need more of the Holy Spirit?

305
00:32:08,468 --> 00:32:11,596
These days, fuck,
everything I touch turns to crap.

306
00:32:30,073 --> 00:32:32,867
<i>It's been a while. How have you been?</i>

307
00:32:35,328 --> 00:32:36,329
Who…

308
00:34:31,736 --> 00:34:32,695
Who's there?

309
00:34:34,405 --> 00:34:36,115
Hey! You punk!

310
00:34:37,492 --> 00:34:39,660
Hey!

311
00:34:45,041 --> 00:34:46,250
Hey, you!

312
00:34:58,012 --> 00:35:00,181
17, HAEBYEON-RO 3-GIL, GANGWON-SI

313
00:35:13,486 --> 00:35:14,445
Hey!

314
00:35:15,238 --> 00:35:16,072
You know me?

315
00:35:16,572 --> 00:35:17,573
Who are you?

316
00:35:18,741 --> 00:35:20,159
Damn, this place is far.

317
00:35:20,868 --> 00:35:22,495
Why meet all the way out here?

318
00:35:28,042 --> 00:35:30,711
You fucking bastard,
you wanna fucking die?

319
00:35:35,007 --> 00:35:36,134
Looking for someone?

320
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:39,095
Where's that bastard Noja?

321
00:35:51,232 --> 00:35:54,193
Watermelons should be sweet this year.

322
00:35:54,277 --> 00:35:55,611
- Is that so?
- Yes.

323
00:35:55,695 --> 00:35:57,113
Fuck.

324
00:35:58,030 --> 00:35:59,991
- Dig in.
- Okay.

325
00:36:02,869 --> 00:36:04,120
This meat's amazing.

326
00:36:04,203 --> 00:36:05,288
- Is it good?
- Yeah.

327
00:36:07,915 --> 00:36:08,916
It's good.

328
00:36:10,501 --> 00:36:11,460
Have a drink.

329
00:36:11,544 --> 00:36:12,420
- Yeah.
- Sure.

330
00:36:12,503 --> 00:36:13,838
Oh man.

331
00:36:16,257 --> 00:36:18,718
- What?
- Lend me your phone.

332
00:36:18,801 --> 00:36:20,511
When did I ever see you?

333
00:36:20,595 --> 00:36:21,721
Do you know us?

334
00:36:22,513 --> 00:36:24,223
We don't know each other,

335
00:36:25,183 --> 00:36:26,184
so I'll pay.

336
00:36:29,854 --> 00:36:32,607
Gosh. What a weird guy.

337
00:36:33,107 --> 00:36:33,983
But

338
00:36:34,859 --> 00:36:37,486
