339
00:36:37,570 --> 00:36:38,529
Okay?

340
00:36:41,407 --> 00:36:42,450
Hey.

341
00:36:45,328 --> 00:36:46,662
- Here.
- Oh.

342
00:36:57,882 --> 00:36:59,175
Come on.

343
00:37:00,927 --> 00:37:02,386
I told you. I'm not him.

344
00:37:02,470 --> 00:37:05,306
Then what the fuck are you two?
Twins or something?

345
00:37:05,389 --> 00:37:06,933
Twins? That's a bit much.

346
00:37:07,016 --> 00:37:09,435
Then what the fuck are you, asshole?

347
00:37:09,518 --> 00:37:11,479
Hey.

348
00:37:12,146 --> 00:37:13,814
Do I look like I'm joking?

349
00:37:13,898 --> 00:37:15,483
You crazy bastard. You wanna die?

350
00:37:21,948 --> 00:37:23,115
That's fine too.

351
00:37:34,835 --> 00:37:36,462
Huh? What the hell is this?

352
00:37:38,714 --> 00:37:40,758
<i>You crazy bastard. You wanna die?</i>

353
00:37:43,552 --> 00:37:45,012
That's fine too.

354
00:37:47,390 --> 00:37:48,724
Do you remember me now?

355
00:37:49,642 --> 00:37:51,310
That's right. It's me.

356
00:37:55,314 --> 00:37:56,148
But you died.

357
00:37:59,318 --> 00:38:01,070
I came back

358
00:38:01,153 --> 00:38:02,405
from hell.

359
00:38:23,175 --> 00:38:24,218
<i>Hello?</i>

360
00:38:32,601 --> 00:38:34,061
Someone else picked up.

361
00:38:39,734 --> 00:38:40,985
Did he get caught?

362
00:38:44,113 --> 00:38:47,158
If he got caught,
they would've had him answer the phone…

363
00:38:49,577 --> 00:38:51,162
so they could track my location.

364
00:38:57,793 --> 00:39:00,254
PURSUING TWO SUSPECTS
INVESTIGATING LINKS TO INCIDENTS

365
00:39:02,423 --> 00:39:05,134
THREE DEAD IN HAESONG CLINIC FIRE
POLICE INVESTIGATE

366
00:39:08,929 --> 00:39:11,140
He must be unable to answer the call.

367
00:39:12,683 --> 00:39:13,976
<i>I'm so sick of this.</i>

368
00:39:14,060 --> 00:39:17,772
You think you'll get off easy?

369
00:39:26,989 --> 00:39:28,115
We're leaving now.

370
00:39:28,783 --> 00:39:30,618
Let's just stay for a moment.

371
00:39:32,119 --> 00:39:32,953
Sure.

372
00:39:35,873 --> 00:39:38,959
If you leave this life behind,

373
00:39:40,002 --> 00:39:41,128
what would you do?

374
00:39:47,218 --> 00:39:49,762
There's a guy in my hometown
who runs a seafood joint.

375
00:39:50,346 --> 00:39:52,640
I'll learn how to cut fish from him

376
00:39:53,140 --> 00:39:56,227
and open a small place.

377
00:39:57,019 --> 00:39:59,230
- A small seafood place?
- Yes.

378
00:39:59,730 --> 00:40:01,524
Nice. I like that.

379
00:40:04,193 --> 00:40:05,569
I'll be your regular.

380
00:40:06,320 --> 00:40:08,155
I'll really open one, Noja.

381
00:40:19,041 --> 00:40:20,709
I shouldn't have called him.

382
00:40:22,878 --> 00:40:24,630
He was living a good life.

383
00:40:28,217 --> 00:40:30,636
Karma really…

384
00:40:32,763 --> 00:40:34,432
sticks with you.

385
00:41:28,944 --> 00:41:32,031
So, you're that bastard?

386
00:41:32,114 --> 00:41:34,575
You and Myeong-su set this up together

387
00:41:35,075 --> 00:41:37,495
